## 18. Security and privacy

Treat security as a core product requirement.

Implement:

- Server-side authorization.
- Supabase Row Level Security for user-owned data.
- Input validation.
- Output validation.
- Safe mathematical rendering.
- Rate limiting.
- Request-size limits.
- Authentication checks on protected endpoints.
